# Post-job verification (both repos)

After finishing **any** coding job in this workspace, always verify **both** packages — even if only one was edited:

## Frontend — `EUNIK`
```bash
npm audit
npm run typecheck
npm run build
```

## Backend — `backend-eunik`
```bash
npm audit
npm run typecheck
npm run build
```

Fix any failures before considering the job done. Report results briefly (pass/fail; note high/critical audit findings).

Do not skip these steps unless the user explicitly says to skip verification.
